<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Eastern Michigan University.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Eastern Michigan University.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>John Nuveen &amp; Co Inc said it received the written award for $39.160 million of Eastern Michigan University Board of Regents, general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a top yield of 5.70 percent in 2017.</p>
</text>
